  "description": "使用特性管理依赖注入组件、定时任务以及事件总线。可通过特性快速获取同接口的不同实现类、通过特性获取配置文件的Model和Value值。支持属性和字段注入。Use Attribute to manage dependency injection components, scheduled tasks, and event buses. You can quickly obtain different implementation classes of the same interface through attributes, and obtain the Model and Value values of configuration files through attributes. Support for property and field injection.",
